        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/9563413a0cdd00501311b75ca31b9914.poster.avif?t=1778060151\" width=800 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/9563413a0cdd00501311b75ca31b9914.webm?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/9563413a0cdd00501311b75ca31b9914.mp4?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Merge Cats Idle Evolution</strong> is a cozy and satisfying merge &amp; collection game where you combine adorable cats to discover new breeds, complete achievements, and build the ultimate feline collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every merge unlocks new surprises, new cats, and new milestones. Perfect for players who enjoy progression-driven, stress-free gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge your way through multiple stages, evolve your cats step by step, and expand your collection with increasingly rare and valuable breeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for collectors: your evolved cats can be added to your <strong>Steam Inventory</strong> and traded or sold on the <strong>Steam Community Market</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/ca25884062a565469d868d7624f3d6df.poster.avif?t=1778060151\" width=800 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/ca25884062a565469d868d7624f3d6df.webm?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/ca25884062a565469d868d7624f3d6df.mp4?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Classic Merge Progression:</strong> Merge two level 1 cats to make level 2, merge two level 2 cats to make level 3, and keep going step by step to unlock higher-level cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Numbered Cat Collection:</strong> Each cat has its own level in the progression chain, turning your board into a satisfying puzzle of “can I push it one level higher?”.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎒 <strong>Steam Inventory Integration:</strong> The <strong>5th, 10th, 15th, 20th, 25th and 30th cats</strong> you unlock can be added to your <strong>Steam Inventory</strong> as special collectible items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 <strong>Sell on Steam Market:</strong> These special cats can be listed and sold on the <strong>Steam Community Market</strong>, letting dedicated players turn their collection into real value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements as you reach new cat levels, complete merge milestones, and expand your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Cozy Visual Style:</strong> Cute cats, clean UI, and a relaxing atmosphere designed for short sessions that easily turn into “just one more merge”.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/673cc28fe0c3c93f275f880ba9966d1e.poster.avif?t=1778060151\" width=800 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/673cc28fe0c3c93f275f880ba9966d1e.webm?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/673cc28fe0c3c93f275f880ba9966d1e.mp4?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/9563413a0cdd00501311b75ca31b9914.poster.avif?t=1778060151\" width=800 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/9563413a0cdd00501311b75ca31b9914.webm?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/9563413a0cdd00501311b75ca31b9914.mp4?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Merge Cats Idle Evolution</strong> is a cozy and satisfying merge &amp; collection game where you combine adorable cats to discover new breeds, complete achievements, and build the ultimate feline collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every merge unlocks new surprises, new cats, and new milestones. Perfect for players who enjoy progression-driven, stress-free gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge your way through multiple stages, evolve your cats step by step, and expand your collection with increasingly rare and valuable breeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for collectors: your evolved cats can be added to your <strong>Steam Inventory</strong> and traded or sold on the <strong>Steam Community Market</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/ca25884062a565469d868d7624f3d6df.poster.avif?t=1778060151\" width=800 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/ca25884062a565469d868d7624f3d6df.webm?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/ca25884062a565469d868d7624f3d6df.mp4?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Classic Merge Progression:</strong> Merge two level 1 cats to make level 2, merge two level 2 cats to make level 3, and keep going step by step to unlock higher-level cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Numbered Cat Collection:</strong> Each cat has its own level in the progression chain, turning your board into a satisfying puzzle of “can I push it one level higher?”.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎒 <strong>Steam Inventory Integration:</strong> The <strong>5th, 10th, 15th, 20th, 25th and 30th cats</strong> you unlock can be added to your <strong>Steam Inventory</strong> as special collectible items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 <strong>Sell on Steam Market:</strong> These special cats can be listed and sold on the <strong>Steam Community Market</strong>, letting dedicated players turn their collection into real value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements as you reach new cat levels, complete merge milestones, and expand your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Cozy Visual Style:</strong> Cute cats, clean UI, and a relaxing atmosphere designed for short sessions that easily turn into “just one more merge”.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/673cc28fe0c3c93f275f880ba9966d1e.poster.avif?t=1778060151\" width=800 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/673cc28fe0c3c93f275f880ba9966d1e.webm?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184710/extras/673cc28fe0c3c93f275f880ba9966d1e.mp4?t=1778060151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
